	(text "01 - Power Input and Charge\nUSB-C VBUS -> ETA6003 switching charger with dynamic power path -> VSYS.\nBattery enters left through Q1 reverse-polarity FET and the PTC.\nENB and USB_DET strapped LOW: charging enabled, ISET1 sets 806 mA = 1C.\nRespin 2026-09-04: no current-sense amplifier (no ADC on this board);\nSTATS drives a local charge LED instead of the stack." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 25 0)
		(effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left top)) (uuid "b1a00002-0000-4000-8000-000000000088"))
